{
  "name": "Path of Tranquility",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can become an island of calm in even the most chaotic of situations. With this feature, you can cast the Sanctuary spell on yourself, no material component required, and it lasts up to 8 hours. Its Saving Throw DC equals 8 + your Proficiency bonus + your Wisdom modifier. A creature that succeeds on the save is Immune to this effect for 1 hour.</p><p>Once you cast the spell in this way, you can't do so again for 1 minute.</p>",
